05 / BUSINESS OPERATIONS
A thoughtful process, from start to finish.
GlowUp's proposed operations prioritize appointment management, cleanliness, customer comfort, and responsible service.

01
Booking & inquiry
Customers contact GlowUp through email, phone, or social media to ask questions and request an appointment.
02
Consultation & preparation
Staff confirm the requested service, explain its scope and price, and ask about relevant sensitivities or preferences.
03
Service delivery
Trained personnel provide the agreed service while following hygiene procedures and product instructions.
04
